## AR + Flow Transfusion 范式总结

```
Text tokens  → AR (CE loss) via CeTowerExit @ L21 (understanding path)
Image spans  → FM (velocity MSE) via ElfFlowTowerExit @ L25 (generation path)
Audio spans  → FM (velocity MSE) via ElfFlowTowerExit @ L11 (generation path, audio_patch space)
Video spans  → FM (velocity MSE) via ElfFlowTowerExit @ L13 (generation path, video_patch space)
```

关键设计决策：
- **Janus decoupling**: und_proj / gen_proj 防止理解与生成互相干扰
- **Patch-level FM**: audio_patch (dim=80) / video_patch (dim=1024) 在原始 patch 空间做 FM，不是 hidden space
- **Text CE at tower exit**: 文本 CE loss 在 tower L21 exit 而非全局 head，允许中间层文本监督
- **Progressive curriculum**: warmup → main → refine，逐步增加音频/视频长度和 CFG 强度
- **GradNorm balance**: per-loss gradient norm 平衡，防止模态间梯度冲突
